# ---- results/: published, with three deliberate exclusions ----
# Published: every metrics table for all six datasets, plus the 23 per-method
# integrated embeddings behind the pbmc3k Fig 2B matrix (results/pbmc3k/latents/).
# Excluded below and available from the authors on request -- see results/README.md:
#   1. per-cell ground-truth label tables (the BRCA ones are dbGaP-derived)
#   2. per-method predicted-label tables
#   3. the two oversized RMS pileup tables (85 MB + 17 MB)
#   4. per-method embeddings for the five datasets other than pbmc3k (size)
results/**/label.csv
results/**/label_major.csv
results/**/knn_pred_label__*.csv
results/**/knn_k10_pred_label.csv
results/**/predicted_ataclabel_*value.csv
# embeddings: only pbmc3k is published; the other five are staged locally for
# on-request sharing (~960 MB), organised identically with their own SOURCES.tsv
results/*/latents/
!results/pbmc3k/latents/

